Author: workbuddy

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # 0 = all games; fill a game's low TitleID to bind to one game

Title: HTTP Share 3DS

Summary: Background HTTP file server for SD card

Description: |
  Runs a small HTTP server in the background while you play.
  From a PC on the same Wi-Fi, browse / upload / download / delete files
  inside sdmc:/3ds/httpshare/ without leaving your game.

  Hotkey: SELECT to open the status panel.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
